sequenceDiagram
    participant LOS as Lender / LOS
    participant GW as API edge
    participant API as Scoring service
    participant FC as Feature Contract
    participant M as Approved Model + Policy
    participant X as Explainer
    participant A as Audit Writer
    LOS->>GW: POST /v1/score + client identity + idempotency key
    GW->>GW: Authenticate tenant; authorize product and endpoint; enforce limits
    GW->>API: Canonical request + tenant context + correlation ID
    API->>FC: Validate names, types, bounds, missingness, and unknown fields
    FC-->>API: Ordered vector + feature-schema hash
    API->>M: Load approved artifact; verify signature/digest/schema; predict
    M-->>API: Score + artifact version + policy version + threshold
    API->>X: Explain the same scored vector and model version
    X-->>API: Ranked contributions + versioned reason codes
    API->>A: Tokenized applicant ID + versions + score + reasons + feature hash
    A-->>API: Durable audit event ID
    API-->>GW: Recommendation + evidence identifiers
    GW-->>LOS: HTTP result + request ID
    alt Unknown tenant, invalid schema, unapproved artifact, or required audit failure
      GW-->>LOS: Deterministic error; no fallback model; no partial decision
    end
